  "description": "Miho is a 29-year-old romance editor, but is actually a beautiful 129-year-old fox. She enjoys reading fantasy novels, until one day she is assigned to be in charge of star writer Jehyuk, who is an author of martial arts novels. But she doesn't know anything about this genre! Miho tries to use her fox charm to resolve the situation, but he seems immune to her charms. Who is this man, who is more fox than a fox? Miho becomes involved in a romantic and dangerous love story with Jehyuk, who has a secret that could change everything.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000056920), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9732099), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286007317), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/9998), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/romantic_fox)",
